{
 "label": "About",
 "regions": {
  "about-01": "<div class=\"phero\"><div class=\"wrap phero-grid\"><div><div class=\"crumb\"><a href=\"./\">Home</a> / About us</div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg> About us</span><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);margin-top:14px\">A platform built from <span style=\"color:var(--blue)\">lived experience</span></h1><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Online Saathi is a strong worker community that connects informal and migrant workers with jobs, welfare, financial services and support — through technology and trusted local Saathis.</p></div><div class=\"kpis\"><div class=\"kpi\"><b>2015</b><span>first work with migrants</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><b>2021</b><span>company incorporated</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><b>2023</b><span>platform launched</span></div><div class=\"kpi\"><b data-count=\"2000\" data-suf=\"+\">2000+</b><span>Saathis today</span></div></div></div></div>",
  "about-02": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"overview\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">01</span><div><b>Overview</b><small>Who we are and how we work</small></div></div></div>",
  "about-03": "<section><div class=\"wrap split\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg> Our story</span><h2>From the factory floor to a national network</h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Our founder, Naresh Sijapati, worked as a child labourer in factories, hotels and tea shops before continuing his education. At Teach for India he saw migrant hardship first-hand.</p>\n    <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">In 2015 he started a digital mobile office to help migrants access jobs, rights and legal aid. A decade later, that idea has become Online Saathi — technology plus 2000+ trained local Saathis.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" style=\"margin-top:22px\" href=\"about.php#history\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"></path></svg> Read our full history</a></div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2 reveal\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3>Trusted local Saathis</h3><p>Community entrepreneurs who know their neighbourhood and language.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9a2.82 2.82 0 0 1 3.79 0l2.96 2.66\"></path><path d=\"m18 15-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m15 18-2-2\"></path></svg></div><h3>Community-first</h3><p>We design around workers’ real lives, not around forms.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><h3>Technology-enabled</h3><p>One app and dashboard for 50+ services.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M7 20h10\"></path><path d=\"M10 20c5.5-2.5.8-6.4 3-10\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 9.4c1.1.8 1.8 2.2 2.3 3.7-2 .4-3.5.4-4.8-.3-1.2-.6-2.3-1.9-3-4.2 2.8-.5 4.4 0 5.5.8z\"></path><path d=\"M14.1 6a7 7 0 0 0-1.1 4c1.9-.1 3.3-.6 4.3-1.4 1-1 1.6-2.3 1.7-4.6-2.7.1-4 1-4.9 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Grassroots empowerment</h3><p>Every service creates income for a local Saathi.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-04": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"stats reveal\">\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"2000\" data-suf=\"+\">2000+</div><div class=\"l\">Saathis onboarded</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"90000\" data-suf=\"+\">90,000+</div><div class=\"l\">workers reached</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"125\" data-suf=\"k+\">125k+</div><div class=\"l\">transactions</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"50\" data-suf=\"+\">50+</div><div class=\"l\">services</div></div>\n    <div class=\"stat\"><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"25\" data-suf=\"+\">25+</div><div class=\"l\">state partners</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-05": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg> Our family</span><h2>One mission, working together</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"org reveal\">\n    <div class=\"node\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9a2.82 2.82 0 0 1 3.79 0l2.96 2.66\"></path><path d=\"m18 15-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m15 18-2-2\"></path></svg> <b>Panah Foundation</b><small>Charitable trust</small></div>\n    <div class=\"vl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"node main\"><b>{{company}}</b><small>For-profit social enterprise</small></div>\n    <div class=\"row3\">\n      <div><div class=\"node\" style=\"border-top:4px solid var(--blue)\"><b>Online Saathi</b><small>Last-mile service platform</small></div></div>\n      <div><div class=\"node\" style=\"border-top:4px solid var(--green)\"><b>Panah Institute</b><small>Skilling initiative</small></div></div>\n      <div><div class=\"node\" style=\"border-top:4px solid var(--red)\"><b>Walk for Dignity</b><small>Grassroots movement</small></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-06": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"history\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">02</span><div><b>History</b><small>A decade of walking with workers</small></div></div></div>",
  "about-07": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:46px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"></path></svg> History</span><h2>Our journey</h2><p class=\"lead\">A decade of working with migrant and informal workers — from relief to rights to a scalable platform.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"tlx\">\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">2015</div><h3>A digital mobile office for migrants</h3><p>Helping migrants access jobs, their rights and legal aid in cities.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-blue\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2018</div><h3>Labour Resource & Support Centre</h3><p>Launched with CSR funding, alongside a registered workers’ union — helping 20,000+ migrants access schemes, entitlements, wages and legal aid.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-green\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">COVID-19</div><h3>Relief for 12,500+ families</h3><p>Food, rations, transport, flight tickets, livelihoods and loans for 12,500+ migrant labourer families — more than ₹2.25 crore raised over two years.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-red\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">2021</div><h3>Shubhlaxmi Multiservices incorporated</h3><p>A for-profit social enterprise, incorporated on 16 July 2021.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-blue\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2022</div><h3>#WalkForMigrant</h3><p>5,100 km through 77 districts in 10 states, with 100+ RTIs and petitions to 50+ district collectors and the PMO.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-green\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">2023</div><h3>Online Saathi platform launched</h3><p>Technology plus trained local Saathis — the 3T model goes live.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-red\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">2025</div><h3>District programmes</h3><p>Worker registration and support pilot in Dantewada, Chhattisgarh (Feb–Mar 2025).</p></div><div class=\"dot s-blue\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ev reveal\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"yr\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">TODAY</div><h3>2000+ Saathis · 90,000+ workers reached</h3><p>125k+ transactions worth ₹150 Cr+, and growing across states and borders.</p></div><div class=\"dot s-green\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-08": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"panel reveal\" style=\"min-height:auto;padding:48px\"><div class=\"ring\" style=\"width:520px;height:520px;right:-180px;top:-180px\"></div><div class=\"ring\" style=\"width:320px;height:320px;right:-80px;top:-80px\"></div>\n    <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:30px;align-items:center\" class=\"walkgrid\">\n      <div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4 16v-2.38C4 11.5 2.97 10.5 3 8c.03-2.72 1.49-6 4.5-6C9.37 2 10 3.8 10 5.5c0 3.11-2 5.66-2 8.68V16a2 2 0 1 1-4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"M20 20v-2.38c0-2.12 1.03-3.12 1-5.62-.03-2.72-1.49-6-4.5-6C14.63 6 14 7.8 14 9.5c0 3.11 2 5.66 2 8.68V20a2 2 0 1 0 4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"M16 17h4\"></path><path d=\"M4 13h4\"></path></svg> Walk for Dignity</span><h2 style=\"color:#fff\">11,111 km on foot, listening to workers</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px\">A grassroots padyatra led by our founder — walking alongside workers where they live and work, to understand what dignified access really means.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"walk\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:0\"><div><b data-count=\"11111\">11,111</b><span>kilometres walked</span></div><div><b data-count=\"1008\">1,008</b><span>days on the road</span></div><div><b data-count=\"22\">22</b><span>states</span></div><div><b data-count=\"4\">4</b><span>countries</span></div></div>\n    </div></div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-09": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:36px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:var(--gtint);color:var(--green)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4 16v-2.38C4 11.5 2.97 10.5 3 8c.03-2.72 1.49-6 4.5-6C9.37 2 10 3.8 10 5.5c0 3.11-2 5.66-2 8.68V16a2 2 0 1 1-4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"M20 20v-2.38c0-2.12 1.03-3.12 1-5.62-.03-2.72-1.49-6-4.5-6C14.63 6 14 7.8 14 9.5c0 3.11 2 5.66 2 8.68V20a2 2 0 1 0 4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"M16 17h4\"></path><path d=\"M4 13h4\"></path></svg> #WalkForMigrant 2022</span><h2>5,100 km for migrant workers’ rights</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"hl-grid\">\n    <div class=\"hl-card s-blue reveal\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4 16v-2.38C4 11.5 2.97 10.5 3 8c.03-2.72 1.49-6 4.5-6C9.37 2 10 3.8 10 5.5c0 3.11-2 5.66-2 8.68V16a2 2 0 1 1-4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"M20 20v-2.38c0-2.12 1.03-3.12 1-5.62-.03-2.72-1.49-6-4.5-6C14.63 6 14 7.8 14 9.5c0 3.11 2 5.66 2 8.68V20a2 2 0 1 0 4 0Z\"></path><path d=\"M16 17h4\"></path><path d=\"M4 13h4\"></path></svg><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"5100\" data-suf=\" km\">5,100 km</div><p>walked through 77 districts</p></div>\n    <div class=\"hl-card s-green reveal\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"10\">10</div><p>states on the route</p></div>\n    <div class=\"hl-card s-red reveal\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><div class=\"n\" data-count=\"100\" data-suf=\"+\">100+</div><p>RTIs and petitions to 50+ district collectors and the PMO</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-10": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"vision-mission\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">03</span><div><b>Vision & Mission</b><small>Why we exist and what we stand for</small></div></div></div>",
  "about-11": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"vm\">\n    <div class=\"card reveal\" style=\"border-top:5px solid var(--blue)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Vision</span><p>An India where every informal and migrant worker can access their rights, services and opportunities with dignity — through a trusted Saathi in every community.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card reveal\" style=\"border-top:5px solid var(--green)\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i bgi\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:var(--gtint);color:var(--green)\">Mission</span><p>To provide affordable, trusted access to welfare, financial services, jobs and essential digital services for informal workers — while expanding earning opportunities for local entrepreneurs.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-12": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg> Mission pillars</span><h2>Four commitments that guide our work</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path></svg></div><h3>Bridging the digital divide</h3><p>Human-assisted access for low-literacy and first-time digital users.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M7 20h10\"></path><path d=\"M10 20c5.5-2.5.8-6.4 3-10\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 9.4c1.1.8 1.8 2.2 2.3 3.7-2 .4-3.5.4-4.8-.3-1.2-.6-2.3-1.9-3-4.2 2.8-.5 4.4 0 5.5.8z\"></path><path d=\"M14.1 6a7 7 0 0 0-1.1 4c1.9-.1 3.3-.6 4.3-1.4 1-1 1.6-2.3 1.7-4.6-2.7.1-4 1-4.9 2z\"></path></svg></div><h3>Job creation at the grassroots</h3><p>Every Saathi is a local micro-entrepreneur earning from service.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg></div><h3>Financial inclusion for all</h3><p>Banking, remittance and insurance that reach the last mile.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card hov reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"22\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"14\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"11\"></line><polygon points=\"12 2 20 7 4 7\"></polygon></svg></div><h3>Welfare schemes for workers</h3><p>From awareness to application — entitlements actually received.</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin:60px 0 30px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg> Values</span><h2>What we stand for</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"grid g3\">\n    <div class=\"card reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5 9.04 7.96a2.17 2.17 0 0 0 0 3.08c.82.82 2.13.85 3 .07l2.07-1.9a2.82 2.82 0 0 1 3.79 0l2.96 2.66\"></path><path d=\"m18 15-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m15 18-2-2\"></path></svg></div><h3>Dignity first</h3><p>Every worker is treated as a valued customer, never a case.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3>Community-led trust</h3><p>Local Saathis, local languages, local accountability.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card reveal\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3>Transparency & safety</h3><p>Clear fees, receipts and consent on every transaction.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-13": "<section><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"center reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg> Global goals</span><h2>Aligned with the UN Sustainable Development Goals</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"sdg reveal\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><span style=\"background:#E5243B\"><b>1</b> No poverty</span><span style=\"background:#FF3A21\"><b>5</b> Gender equality</span><span style=\"background:#A21942\"><b>8</b> Decent work & economic growth</span><span style=\"background:#DD1367\"><b>10</b> Reduced inequalities</span></div>\n</div></section>",
  "about-14": "<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"roadmap\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"cnum\">04</span><div><b>Roadmap 2021–2031</b><small>Where we have been and where we are going</small></div></div></div>",
  "about-15": "<section class=\"sec-alt\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"card reveal\" style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 34px;display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center\"><span class=\"st st-done\" style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px\">ACHIEVED</span><span class=\"st st-now\" style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px\">IN PROGRESS</span><span class=\"st st-plan\" style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px\">PLANNED</span><span class=\"st st-vis\" style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px\">VISION</span></div><div class=\"flow reveal\" style=\"margin-bottom:56px\">\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-green\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z\"></path><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div><b>2021–23</b><p>Foundation</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><b>2024–25</b><p>Scale the network</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-amber\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"16\" height=\"16\" x=\"4\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect width=\"6\" height=\"6\" x=\"9\" y=\"9\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M15 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M15 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 15h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 15h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 20v2\"></path></svg></div><b>2026</b><p>Online Saathi 3.0</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-red\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg></div><b>2027–29</b><p>Deepen impact & sustainability</p></div>\n    <div class=\"fs\"><div class=\"chip c-blue\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"></path></svg></div><b>2030–31</b><p>A Saathi for every worker</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"road\">\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2021</div><div class=\"d s-green\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-done\">ACHIEVED</span><h3>Company incorporated</h3><p>{{company}} incorporated on 16 July 2021 as a for-profit social enterprise.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2022</div><div class=\"d s-green\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-done\">ACHIEVED</span><h3>Listening at scale</h3><p>#WalkForMigrant — 5,100 km through 77 districts in 10 states — shaping the platform around workers’ real needs.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2023</div><div class=\"d s-green\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-done\">ACHIEVED</span><h3>Online Saathi platform launched</h3><p>Technology plus trained local Saathis — the 3T model of Team × Tech × Training goes live.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2024</div><div class=\"d s-green\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-done\">ACHIEVED</span><h3>Services and network scale up</h3><ul><li>Indo-Nepal remittance, Micro ATM (AEPS), PAN, travel and bill payments</li><li>Saathi network grows across 25+ state partners</li></ul></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">2025</div><div class=\"d s-green\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-done\">ACHIEVED</span><h3>2000+ Saathis and district programmes</h3><ul><li>2000+ Saathis onboarded · 90,000+ workers reached</li><li>125k+ transactions worth ₹150 Cr+</li><li>Worker registration and support pilot in Dantewada, Chhattisgarh</li></ul></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--blue)\">2026</div><div class=\"d s-blue\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-now\">IN PROGRESS</span><h3>Online Saathi 3.0</h3><ul><li>Jobs platform and government scheme engine</li><li>Community platform for workers</li><li>Digital Worker Passport and trust score</li><li>New worker app experience with membership and Saathi plans</li></ul></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:#B57800\">2027</div><div class=\"d s-amber\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-plan\">PLANNED</span><h3>Deepen livelihoods (Apr 2027 – Mar 2028 targets)</h3><ul><li>500 active Saathis earning from services</li><li>90,000 workers with verified cost, time or income benefit</li><li>Saathi income of ₹1,500–2,000 a month with repeat customers</li><li>20+ formal and quality employment referrals</li></ul></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:#B57800\">2028</div><div class=\"d s-amber\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-plan\">PLANNED</span><h3>Path to sustainability</h3><ul><li>Revenue to exceed expenses</li><li>Cross-border support across the India–Nepal migration corridor</li></ul></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:#B57800\">2029</div><div class=\"d s-amber\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-plan\">PLANNED</span><h3>More services, more states</h3><ul><li>Expand Saathi specialisations — Bank, Bima, Rojgar and Yojana Mitra</li><li>Grow the partner network of service providers and employers</li></ul></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">2030</div><div class=\"d s-red\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-vis\">VISION</span><h3>Trusted infrastructure for informal work</h3><p>A recognised, trusted digital identity and service record for every worker we serve.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"ry reveal\"><div class=\"y\" style=\"color:var(--red)\">2031</div><div class=\"d s-red\"></div><div class=\"card\"><span class=\"st st-vis\">VISION</span><h3>A Saathi for every worker</h3><p>Every informal and migrant worker can reach their rights, services and opportunities with dignity — through a trusted Saathi in their community.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>"
 },
